{"availability":"available","full":"Wardieo/revbaze","name":"revbaze","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-09T23:22:26Z","updated":"2026-10-11T06:06:41Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://revbaze.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://revbaze.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:03.185Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:03.185Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:03.185Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:15:03.185Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A business dashboard for creating, customizing, and managing review-link cards. Built by refactoring the existing React/Vite app; its visual system, reusable Radix-based button, authentication integration, and light/dark foundations are retained.","The app includes a business dashboard, server-saved five-step onboarding, and public pages for explicitly published review cards. Review scraping, external platform authentication, API aggregation, AI responses, review imports, campaigns, and payment processing are not implemented. Overview remains a labeled mock activity preview. Outbound clicks do not imply completed reviews.","The Overview tab uses deterministic sample activity for Studio North, independent of Supabase workspace tables. It skips the workspace query and onboarding gate on this route, so a missing public.businesses table cannot block the preview. Authentication and the other navbar pages retain their existing behavior; their cloud database setup still requires the migration. No remote schema is changed by this preview."],"features":["Collapsible/mobile sidebar, grouped navigation, business identity, account menus, search, and a prominent card creation action.","Three-step onboarding with logo upload, business/category details, manually configured review links, and first-card branding.","Review-card create/edit/duplicate/delete, active/inactive states, search/status filters, pagination, future-URL copying, and analytics links. Duplicates start inactive. Destructive deletions require confirmation.","Desktop editor with live preview; mobile edit/preview switch. Per-card logos, accent/background colors, button styles, heading, description, and corner options. Destination selection, enable/disable, drag-and-drop…","Review destinations: Google, Facebook, Trustpilot, Yelp, G2, Capterra, Tripadvisor, Product Hunt, App Store, Google Play, and custom HTTPS URLs. Edit names/URLs, toggle, remove, test links, and see which cards use them.…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Wardieo/revbaze/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"179e8852356e8fbdb72ff565b6848d07cb82f702ebfd3ef490589dace9f259c2","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:03.360Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:03.360Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A business dashboard for creating, customizing, and managing review-link cards. Built by refactoring the existing React/Vite app; its visual system, reusable Radix-based button, authentication integration, and light/dark foundations are retained.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Wardieo/revbaze/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Dedicated pages live at /#/login, /#/signup, /#/check-email, and /#/forgot-password.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Wardieo/revbaze/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Start a separate business through Account menu → Set up a new business.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Wardieo/revbaze/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Apply 202610090005stripebilling.sql after migration 004 and follow Stripe billing setup to configure the rotated server secret, monthly Stripe prices, webhook, and portal.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Wardieo/revbaze/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"179e8852356e8fbdb72ff565